  "notes": "OPT names the whole suite; the launch post is titled after OPT-175B. The arXiv paper v1 was submitted on 2022-05-02, one day before the launch post; the paper's own model card gives May 3, 2022 as the release date, so no alternative release date is recorded. Smaller sizes were trained on the same data with similar settings as OPT-175B; intermediate checkpoints of 2.7B, 6.7B and 13B were added to the metaseq README later (December 2022). The Hugging Face model cards for facebook/opt-* say they were written by the Hugging Face team, so they are not used for facts. OPT-IML (instruction-tuned OPT, December 2022) is not covered by this record."
